          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/FERNBLOCK_1.jpg",
            "heading": "Fernblock® Technology",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "subheading": "Developed through research by Cantabria Labs and Dr Fitzpatrick's team at Harvard Medical School, Fernblock® Technology was created to provide comprehensive protection against the damaging effects of the sun. Derived from the tropical fern Polypodium leucotomos, Fernblock delivers powerful antioxidant activity to help prevent and repair skin damage caused by UVA, UVB, Visible Light and Infrared A.",
