            "heading": "ASPA-Fernblock®",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "subheading": "ASPA-Fernblock® is a patented, plant-derived technology developed by Cantabria Labs that combines Fernblock® (<em>Polypodium leucotomos</em>) with ASPA (<em>Aspalathus linearis</em>). This advanced bioactive complex provides powerful antioxidant activity and enhanced full-spectrum protection against UVA, UVB, visible light and infrared-A radiation, while supporting the skin's natural repair mechanisms and optimising vitamin D function to help keep skin healthy, resilient and protected.",
            "button_label": "Learn more",
