            "heading": "RETINDUO® Technology",
            "heading_size": "h1",
            "subheading": "An exclusive dual-retinoid system that combines pure retinol in microsponges with AOX Tech-encapsulated retinal, supported by a targeted natural booster complex to optimise bioavailability, enhance retinoid stability and deliver powerful yet controlled skin renewal enhancing stability and skin comfort.",
